  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Negation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8596;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8596;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;(using De&#39;Morgan&#39;s laws)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
